su name priest tools at filename "world/workplace/confederation" be map def
su name search be search ob text input fromstate wo web by num 3 can
su name download be download from filename input as wo web to filename input can
su name read be read from filename input become wo text to name text out can
su name read markdown be read from filename input become wo markdown to name text out can
su name write be write ob text input to filename input can
su name compile html be compile from filename input fromstate name markdown become name html to filename input can
su name compile pdf be compile from filename input fromstate name markdown become name pdf to filename input can
su name list be list can
su name command be command ob text input to name text out can
prah

exists su name world tools ob bool truth ya
exists su name world root ob filename "world" be default ya
exists su name world agent ob text "confederation-priest" be text ya
exists su name world place ob text "workplace" be text ya

exists su name priest be mind via state "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" ya
ob text "You are the Confederation Priest. Work inside the current directory. Use tools to search, download, read, write, list, and command as needed. Goals: update confederation knowledge (chronology, glossary, contacts), track new items from https://www.llresearch.org/channeling and https://www.buzzsprout.com/2320595, and leave a brief maintenance note in the current directory (write it before compiling html/pdf)." for name priest with name priest tools be session do
